[1m[38;2;255;169;64mVERBS[0m
  spawn <task>           [38;2;156;163;175mstart an isolated agent Job on a task[0m
  ls                     [38;2;156;163;175mwhat is running, what it has spent, and who needs you[0m
  show <job>             [38;2;156;163;175mone Job in full, and why it needs you[0m
  board <job>            [38;2;156;163;175mtake a Job over yourself: worktree and resume command[0m
  answer <job> <answer>  [38;2;156;163;175mgive a waiting Job your decision; let it continue[0m
